{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"isaiah 1:11","book":"isaiah","lang":"id","chapter":1,"translation":"Untuk apa bagiku banyaknya korban sembelihanmu? kata Yahweh. Aku sudah kenyang ⟨dengan⟩ korban bakaran domba jantan dan lemak ternah apa gunanya bagiku banyaknya korban sembelihanmu?\" kata Yahweh. \"Aku sudah kenyang ⟨dengan⟩ korban bakaran domba jantan dan lemak ternak piaraan; dan darah lembu, domba, dan kambing jantan — tidak aku rindukan.\"","tokens":[{"surface":"למה","gloss":"Untuk apa"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"bagiku"},{"surface":"רב","gloss":"banyaknya"},{"surface":"זבחיכם","gloss":"korban sembelihanmu"},{"surface":"יאמר","gloss":"kata"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"שבעתי","gloss":"aku sudah kenyang"},{"surface":"עלות","gloss":"korban bakaran"},{"surface":"אילים","gloss":"domba jantan"},{"surface":"וחלב","gloss":"dan lemak"},{"surface":"מריאים","gloss":"ternak piaraan"},{"surface":"ודם","gloss":"dan darah"},{"surface":"פרים","gloss":"lembu"},{"surface":"וכבשים","gloss":"domba"},{"surface":"ועתודים","gloss":"kambing jantan"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"tidak"},{"surface":"חפצתי","gloss":"aku rindukan"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T11:08:04.163382996Z","model":"glm-5.2"}